    "description": "🎨 Affordable Art Rare Binder Builds — Part 6\n\n👷 We have a very simple theme today, but with two different pages contrasting city Pokemon and countryside Pokemon at work!\n\n💫 Art rares are a huge part of what got me back into collecting at the end of the Sword & Shield era and the start of the Scarlet & Violet era. With this series, I’m looking to spread the joy of collecting Japanese art rares with binder inspo.\n\n🙌🏼 You can copy my binder card for card, or take creative liberty and substitute out different cards you think would look better! For those looking for the English counterparts of today’s additions, you can find them below in order from top-bottom / left-right.\n\nSteelix 208/182 — Paradox Rift\nTimburr 125/086 — Black Bolt\nRiolu 10 — Mega Evolution Promos\nChansey 187/167 — Twilight Masquerade\nDugtrio 239/217 — Ascended Heroes\nMachoke 177/165 — Scarlet & Violet 151\nIndeedee 169/155 — Fantastical Parade (TCGP)\nTimburr 183/167 — Twilight Masquerade\nDonphan ex 206/161 — Wisdom of Sea & Sky (TCGP)\nMudsdale 175/162 — Temporal Forces\nRhyperior 169/155 — Space-Time Smackdown (TCGP)\nExcadrill 174/162 — Temporal Forces\nTorkoal 172/167 — Twilight Masquerade\n\n✅ Follow @miraicardshop and check the link in bio for affordable Japanese Art Rares on our eBay!",
